IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. FREEZE.

DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 ACC-STATUS PIC X.
01 KYC-FLAG PIC X.
01 FRAUD-HOLD PIC X.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.

    DISPLAY "ENTER ACCOUNT STATUS (A/I):"
    ACCEPT ACC-STATUS

    DISPLAY "ENTER KYC STATUS (Y/N):"
    ACCEPT KYC-FLAG

    DISPLAY "ENTER FRAUD HOLD (Y/N):"
    ACCEPT FRAUD-HOLD

    IF ACC-STATUS = 'A'
       AND KYC-FLAG = 'Y'
       AND FRAUD-HOLD = 'N'
        DISPLAY "ALLOW"
    ELSE
        DISPLAY "BLOCK"
    END-IF.

    STOP RUN.
